  "interpretation": {
    "observation": "Both SReLU checkpoints route materially more gates and upstream gradient energy into the exactly clipped negative half-space than the SwiGLU checkpoint. Wider SReLU increases, rather than reduces, the sampled inactive-channel burden.",
